amstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2015960/extras/157316cb8de36853ed9855b1c121da67.poster.avif?t=1787759258\" width=1170 height=500 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2015960/extras/157316cb8de36853ed9855b1c121da67.webm?t=1787759258\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2015960/extras/157316cb8de36853ed9855b1c121da67.mp4?t=1787759258\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><br>A cast of quirky characters </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet 30 eccentric business owners and complete unique missions to secure their business. Deliver spicy wings at top speed for Las Aves Hermanas, perform tricks to stir up milkshakes for Milky Boys, slap up posters for The Daily Tatter... just remember, no matter what, the customer is always right!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2015960/extras/68b6c5cf28524868f3bf4dbab6e8eb43.poster.avif?t=1787759258\" width=1170 height=500 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2015960/extras/68b6c5cf28524868f3bf4dbab6e8eb43.webm?t=1787759258\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2015960/extras/68b6c5cf28524868f3bf4dbab6e8eb43.mp4?t=1787759258\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Triumph over totalitarianism! </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embark on a journey satirising the gig economy, media influencers, big tech, and more! With an outlandish villain and totalitarian government to overthrow, it’s up to you to save the world one parcel at a time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2015960/extras/96723549afa69f6314ce3be718209a9d.poster.avif?t=1787759258\" width=1170 height=500 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2015960/extras/96723549afa69f6314ce3be718209a9d.webm?t=1787759258\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2015960/extras/96723549afa69f6314ce3be718209a9d.mp4?t=1787759258\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "short_description": "Ditch the 9-5 and embrace the high-octane life of a freelance bicycle messenger! Skid, grind, and wallride across eight huge levels, delivering parcels for a cast of eccentric business owners. Find shortcuts, dodge traffic, and maybe even save the world!", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Japanese, Korean, Portuguese - Brazil, Simplified Chinese<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "reviews": "“Parcel Corps is easily one of the best attempts at revitalising a highly addictive subgenre of arcade game.”<br>TheSixthAxis<br><br>“Put Crazy Taxi, Dave Mirra Freestyle BMX and Jet Set Radio into a blender, and chances are you’d get something like Billy Goat Entertainment’s Parcel Corps.”<br>GameSpew<br><br>“If you love classic Dreamcast games then you'll have a blast with Parcel Corps and its colourful yet oddly sinister setting.”<br>Video Chums<br>", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2015960/header.jpg?t=1787759258", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2015960/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1787759258", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2015960/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1787759258", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong